create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53376, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019yRHiBhoEXACHEJ26XP2Lv", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54812, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014m85yq7p7uwQXhG21utyPQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55112, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014m85yq7p7uwQXhG21utyPQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55112, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014m85yq7p7uwQXhG21utyPQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59619, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was failing health checks with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy, so I used v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment tool, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried once and it finished.\n- Now us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001 (SEV2, open):** the incident create call timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- **What it says:** what failed, what I did, the stalled first attempt, and where things stand now.\n- **Follow-ups listed:** find out why v2.3.1 fails, and look into the deployment tool error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0179jyCtYFMM96iMYzbo5aP8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CTfDgA5EjtActvPGLxcQWN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01RwNkfQ7U8QRDV8Zu7grmGa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KR3ZZPEhXLUyHx1hkZPGPj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same target version again should be safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015Eg98eLBf7xCYaGg7gEoKU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NPkPid4H9teCXdnQH8NnM4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01A7Lny8HwoMhKyjcx9YGDfj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019yRHiBhoEXACHEJ26XP2Lv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left versions mixed across regions. A retry finished the rollback in us-west and eu-west. Current state: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, error rate 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and look into the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014m85yq7p7uwQXhG21utyPQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was failing health checks with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy, so I used v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment tool, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried once and it finished.\n- Now us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001 (SEV2, open):** the incident create call timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- **What it says:** what failed, what I did, the stalled first attempt, and where things stand now.\n- **Follow-ups listed:** find out why v2.3.1 fails, and look into the deployment tool error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}